# Gams (chamois): summer coat O with o light and an l dorsal stripe, light
# belly c, dark legs l, the black-and-white face mask w/k (a k stripe
# through the eye), short hooked horns k, a small pointed ear. Faces right;
# mirror = auto.
# idle: 0 = standing; 1 = chewing (jaw dropped) with an ear flick.
# crouch (telegraph, held): body low, legs bent, head down, horns forward.
# hop (held): legs tucked, body stretched. squished (held): sits dazed with
# two little stars over the horns.
# Built with a layered scratch script (parts + per-part k outline), frozen
# to text here.
sprite = gams
size   = 24x20
origin = 12,20
hitbox = 4,6,16,14
mirror = auto
anim   = idle     frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = crouch   frames=1
anim   = hop      frames=1
anim   = squished frames=1
